---
import { ArrowRight, MessageCircleMore } from "@lucide/astro";
import { site } from "../data/content";
---

<section
  class="final-cta section section--soft"
  aria-labelledby="final-cta-title"
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="final-cta__panel" data-reveal>
      <div class="final-cta__backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="final-cta__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="erp-window">
          <div class="erp-window__bar">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i><span>ERP · Estoque</span>
          </div>
          <div class="erp-window__body">
            <aside><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></aside>
            <div class="erp-window__main">
              <div class="erp-window__heading">
                <span></span><small>Unidade Centro</small>
              </div>
              <div class="erp-window__cards">
                <div><small>Saldo no sistema</small><b>Disponível</b></div><div>
                  <small>Conferência física</small><b>Gôndola</b>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="erp-window__list">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="erp-window__action">
                <i></i><span>Conferir execução na gôndola</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="erp-window__tag">
          <span></span><b>ERP e gôndola</b><small>visão complementar</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="final-cta__content">
        <h2 id="final-cta-title">
          Sua próxima verificação pode começar <span>na gôndola.</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Conte como sua rede funciona. A Shelfia ajuda você a entender se uma
          rotina de visibilidade da execução faz sentido para a sua operação.
        </p>
        <div class="final-cta__actions">
          <a class="button button--light" href="#diagnostico"
            >Solicitar diagnóstico <ArrowRight
              size={19}
              aria-hidden="true"
            /></a
          >
          <a
            class="final-cta__whatsapp"
            href={site.whatsappUrl}
            target={site.whatsappNumber ? "_blank" : undefined}
            rel={site.whatsappNumber ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
            ><MessageCircleMore size={19} aria-hidden="true" />Falar pelo
            WhatsApp</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta__panel {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 29rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    padding: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .final-cta__backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -2;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--navy-950), #172554);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium);
  }
  .final-cta__backdrop::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at 87% 35%,
      rgb(59 130 246 / 32%),
      transparent 22rem
    );
    content: "";
  }
  .final-cta__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: 35rem;
  }
  .final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3.1rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .final-cta h2 span {
    color: #69e5b1;
  }
  .final-cta__content > p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    color: #c4d2e7;
  }
  .final-cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .final-cta__whatsapp {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--white);
    font-weight: 730;
  }

  .final-cta__visual {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.5%;
    bottom: 8%;
    width: min(44%, 33rem);
    transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(2deg);
  }
  .erp-window {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(191 219 254 / 45%);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #f8fbff;
    box-shadow: 0 2rem 4rem rgb(2 6 23 / 38%);
  }
  .erp-window__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.38rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dde8fb;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .erp-window__bar i {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #cbd5e1;
  }
  .erp-window__bar i:nth-child(2) {
    background: #a5b4fc;
  }
  .erp-window__bar i:nth-child(3) {
    background: #86efac;
  }
  .erp-window__bar span {
    margin-left: 0.45rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .erp-window__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18% 1fr;
    min-height: 15rem;
  }
  .erp-window__body aside {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    background: #172554;
    padding: 1.05rem 0.65rem;
  }
  .erp-window__body aside b {
    height: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #516a9f;
  }
  .erp-window__body aside b:first-child {
    background: #60a5fa;
  }
  .erp-window__main {
    padding: 1.1rem;
  }
  .erp-window__heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .erp-window__heading span {
    width: 43%;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #1e3a8a;
  }
  .erp-window__heading small,
  .erp-window small {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .erp-window__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .erp-window__cards div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.65rem;
  }
  .erp-window__cards b {
    color: #172554;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .erp-window__cards div:last-child b {
    color: #059669;
  }
  .erp-window__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.05rem;
  }
  .erp-window__list span {
    position: relative;
    height: 0.38rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: #e6edf9;
  }
  .erp-window__list span::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: var(--line);
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: #93c5fd;
    content: "";
  }
  .erp-window__list span:nth-child(1) {
    --line: 78%;
  }
  .erp-window__list span:nth-child(2) {
    --line: 52%;
  }
  .erp-window__list span:nth-child(3) {
    --line: 88%;
  }
  .erp-window__list span:nth-child(4) {
    --line: 63%;
  }
  .erp-window__action {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: #e8f7f0;
    padding: 0.55rem;
    color: #047857;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .erp-window__action i {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .erp-window__tag {
    position: absolute;
    right: -1.1rem;
    bottom: -1.3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    column-gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 70%);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 94%);
    box-shadow: 0 0.9rem 2rem rgb(2 6 23 / 20%);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    transform: rotate(4deg);
  }
  .erp-window__tag span {
    grid-row: span 2;
    width: 1.9rem;
    height: 1.9rem;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #8b5cf6);
  }
  .erp-window__tag b {
    color: #172554;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }
  .erp-window__tag small {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 47.999rem) {
    .final-cta__panel {
      min-height: 43rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem 22rem;
    }
    .final-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 8.2vw, 2.1rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
    }
    .final-cta__visual {
      right: 4%;
      bottom: 2.25rem;
      width: 88%;
      transform: perspective(900px) rotateY(-4deg);
    }
    .erp-window__body {
      min-height: 12.5rem;
    }
    .final-cta__actions {
      display: grid;
    }
    .final-cta__whatsapp {
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
